    "title_en": "On Chain Rule and Renormalization",
    "abstract_en": "We discuss the relationship between the chain rule for the divergence operator and the renormalization property for weak solutions of the continuity equation. We construct an example of bounded divergence-free vector field on the plane, which demonstrates that in general the first property is not sufficient for the second one.",
